  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/tarball/v0.16.10",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/zipball/v0.16.10",
  "body": "## Provider and media support\n\n- Kenari: named free chat and image routes, credential validation, exact-model identity checks, and empty-response protection. Free routes use a shared renewable daily account allowance; the adapter never retries a paid alias.\n- Mistral: Voxtral transcription through the existing audio-transcriptions endpoint, including multipart uploads and normalized responses.\n- Includes the onomeo response-model identity guard merged since v0.16.9.\n\nThe separately signed catalog update adds 25 model routes, re-enables two, and disables one unsupported route (net +26 enabled). Model rows are not seeded by this release. Premium catalog access remains immediate; Free access remains subject to the existing 30-day gate. NVIDIA developer endpoints retain their development/testing-only caveat.\n\nUpdate the app to use the new adapters. Desktop installers and stable Docker images are built from this release tag.\n\nExisting local disabled-model preferences remain respected; re-enabled catalog routes can be enabled manually on installations where they are still disabled.\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(search): a lone-surrogate entity in a hit title corrupted every result by @tashdroid in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1689\n* fix(search): stop Brave decorating every hit with <strong> tags by @tashdroid in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1687\n* fix(keys): key labels can inject lines into the .env export by @tashdroid in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1686\n* fix(routes): sort-preset whitelist rejects inherited Object members (500 on /sort/constructor) by @tashdroid in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1685\n* fix(db): legacy baseline re-run no longer crashes on a model-id collision (#1603) by @tashdroid in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1683\n* fix(anthropic,gemini): client-profile keys authenticate /v1/messages and /v1beta by @tashdroid in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1682\n* fix(router): rerank and moderation honour the per-key model scope by @tashdroid in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1677\n* fix(backups): bound the automatic dump pile (#1675) by @tashdroid in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1679\n* fix(responses): end a truncated turn as incomplete, not completed by @jayhemnani9910 in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1624\n* fix(providers): give each streamed Gemini and Sail tool call its own index by @jayhemnani9910 in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1623\n* Fix/cloudflare account daily quota by @The88788 in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1622\n* docs(readme): credit jayhemnani9910 by @tashfeenahmed in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1691\n* fix(onomeo): reject substituted model identities by @tashfeenahmed in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1694\n* feat: Kenari free routes and Mistral transcription by @tashfeenahmed in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1703\n\n## New Contributors\n* @jayhemnani9910 made their first contribution in https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/pull/1624\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tashfeenahmed/freellmapi/compare/v0.16.9...v0.16.10",
